rder border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-briefcase size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="6" rx="2"></rect></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">MSME Consulting</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Powered by GAP360™ — our flagship methodology that identifies business gaps and drives end-to-end implementation.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/msme-consulting" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-school size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M18 5v16"></path><path d="m4 6 7.106-3.79a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0L20 6"></path><path d="m6 11-3.52 2.147a1 1 0 0 0-.48.854V19a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5a1 1 0 0 0-.48-.853L18 11"></path><path d="M6 5v16"></path><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Institution Building</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">End-to-end advisory for university setup, skill centres, AICTE/UGC compliance and curriculum design.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/institution-building-skill-development" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Strategic Research</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Market research and feasibility studies that turn data into strategic advantage for informed decisions.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/strategic-research-feasibility" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-landmark size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 18v-7"></path><path d="M11.12 2.198a2 2 0 0 1 1.76.006l7.866 3.847c.476.233.31.949-.22.949H3.474c-.53 0-.695-.716-.22-.949z"></path><path d="M14 18v-7"></path><path d="M18 18v-7"></path><path d="M3 22h18"></path><path d="M6 18v-7"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Policy Advisory</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Shaping policy through research-backed advisory for government bodies and institutions.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/policy-advisory" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Learn more →</a></div></article></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="about-heading" class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-14"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="about-heading" class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Bridging the Gap Between Strategy and Execution</h2><p class="mt-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC is built on one belief — consulting should not end with a report. We partner with MSME founders, institutions, and industry bodies to identify gaps and implement solutions until the job is done.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal lg:pt-2"><ul class="divide-y divide-ink-tint border-y border-ink-tint"><li class="flex gap-3 py-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 block size-[6px] shrink-0 rotate-45 bg-gold"></span><span class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">MSMEs in India lack implementation support — they get reports, not results.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 py-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 block size-[6px] shrink-0 rotate-45 bg-gold"></span><span class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Institutions lack expert guidance — they struggle with compliance, setup and curriculum.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 py-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 block size-[6px] shrink-0 rotate-45 bg-gold"></span><span class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Organisations lack strategic research — decisions are made without data or feasibility.</span></li><li class="flex gap-3 py-3.5"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 block size-[6px] shrink-0 rotate-45 bg-gold"></span><span class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Policy lacks research backing — decisions are made without ground reality.</span></li></ul><p class="mt-6 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-gold md:text-3xl">SBC bridges all four.</p><div class="mt-4"><a href="/about-sbc" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">About SBC →</a></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="divisions-heading" class="border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash py-10"><div class="shell"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="divisions-heading" class="sr-only">Our core divisions</h2><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><li class="flex min-w-0 items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-briefcase mt-0.5 size-8 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="6" rx="2"></rect></svg><span class="min-w-0"><span class="block text-[24px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink">Business</span><span class="mt-1 block text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">MSME Consulting powered by GAP360™</span></span></li><li class="flex min-w-0 items-start gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-school mt-0.5 size-8 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M18 5v16"></path><path d="m4 6 7.106-3.79a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0L20 6"></path><path d="m6 11-3.52 2.147a1 1 0 0 0-.48.854V19a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5a1 1 0 0 0-.48-.853L18 11"></path><path d="M6 5v16"></path><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2"></circle></svg><span class="min-w-0"><span class="block text-[24px] font-semibold u